  "body": "Beach days, coffee dates, long lunches and easy trips to the supermarket. Imagine living somewhere where the car becomes more of an option than a necessity. One of the neighbours shared with us that they've travelled less than 30,000km in their car over a period of more than 10 years, simply because of this incredible location. Living proof that you might not need the car nearly as much as you think!\r\n\r\nWelcome to 22A Tamariki Avenue, where everything you love about Orewa is quite literally on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nJust look at how close you are:\r\n\r\n- Under 150m to Orewa Medical Centre\r\n- Under 200m to two supermarkets\r\n- Under 200m to Orewa Library\r\n- Under 300m to Orewa's vibrant restaurants and cafés\r\n- Approximately 370m to beautiful Orewa Beach\r\n\r\nAnd the best part? It's a completely flat walk to everything. No hills to navigate, just easy, relaxed coastal living. Spend less time maintaining your home and more time enjoying the Orewa Bowling Club, estuary walkway, Orewa Surf Club and everything else this wonderful seaside community has to offer. It's hard to imagine a more convenient location.\r\n\r\nConstructed in classic brick,cedar and tile, this low-maintenance, single-level home offers two bedrooms, a family bathroom plus a separate second toilet, separate laundry, a single internal-access garage and additional off-street parking. With great bones, the home provides a fantastic foundation for those wanting to add their own personality, with opportunities to modernise the kitchen and bathroom and further enhance its appeal.\r\n\r\nIf you'd prefer a little more greenery, take a look at the image where we've digitally added grass to illustrate how the outdoor area could be returned to lawn while still retaining additional off-street parking. A great opportunity to create a garden space to suit your lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFor investors, this is a particularly attractive opportunity. Currently rented at $630 per week, the combination of low-maintenance construction, easy-care grounds and an exceptionally central location makes for a compelling investment. With everything within walking distance, the property has broad rental appeal, along with the potential to enhance both its rental return and long-term value through modernisation.\r\n\r\nFor those looking to downsize, it's equally appealing. Leave the car in the garage, wander down for your morning coffee, meet friends for lunch, enjoy a game of bowls or take an afternoon stroll along the beach.\r\n\r\nLess time maintaining a home, less time in the car and more time enjoying everything that makes Orewa such a wonderful place to live.\r\n\r\nTo view the property documents copy this link into your browser : https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/9IBY",
